0406F2             1038*   ; Round a u32 size or offset up to the next four-byte boundary.
0406F2             1039*   ; Calling convention will be finalized with the 32-bit arithmetic helper.
0406F2             1040*   agnb_align4:
0406F2 C3 F6 06 04 1041*       jp agnb_not_implemented
0406F6             1042*   
0406F6             1043*   ; Common fail-closed body used by every scaffolded routine.
0406F6             1044*   agnb_not_implemented:
